Subject: [PATCH 2/3] T2 as written

Red step, run against T1's build as the plan states: 95 failures over
tests.test_check_numbers.Filter and tests.test_downloads.MarkdownAndWord.
- test_word_questions_are_one_cell_tables: "AssertionError: 0 != N" per lab
  (is_label finds no QuestionLabel3 to 5, so labelled is empty).
- test_word_label_styles_add_only_an_outline_level: "no style QuestionLabel3"
  (and 4, 5) per lab.
- test_word_label_levels_match_the_page: [] != the page's levels per lab.
- test_word_label_outside_h3_to_h5_fails, both subtests: "'Question Label 3 to
  5' not found" in the old filter's "needs its colours" error.
Regenerating tools/reference.docx changed only word/styles.xml.
